\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program offers participants business exposure, professional development, mentorship, and hands-on experience across operational and commercial areas of the organization.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>This early-career development initiative aims to find, mentor, and fast-track high-potential Nigerian graduates into tomorrow’s leadership roles across Africa’s changing energy sector.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>Successful candidates will gain industry experience, leadership development, and the opportunity to build rewarding careers within one of Nigeria’s leading energy companies.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Benefits\\u003C\\u002Fstrong>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>The Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Progra\\u003Cstrong>m\\u003C\\u002Fstrong> offers the following benefits;\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Structured graduate trainee programme\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Industry-leading mentorship and development\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Practical workplace experience\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Exposure to Nigeria’s energy sector\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Leadership and career development opportunities\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Professional and technical skills enhancement\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Long-term career growth potential\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>AP Graduate Trainee Program Requirements\\u003C\\u002Fstrong>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>To be eligible for the AP Graduate Trainee Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>hold a minimum of Bachelor’s Degree with Second Class Upper (2:1)\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Engineering disciplines including:\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Chemical Engineering\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Petroleum Engineering\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Mechanical Engineering\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Metallurgical Engineering\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Electrical Engineering\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Business-related disciplines are also eligible\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Minimum of five (5) O’Level credits including English Language and Mathematics in one sitting\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Must have completed NYSC\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Valid NYSC discharge certificate required\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Willingness to relocate anywhere within Nigeria\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>AP Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Required Documents\\u003C\\u002Fstrong>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>While applying for the AP Graduate Trainee Program 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>O’ Level Results\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Bachelor’s Degree Certificate\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>NYSC Certificate\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Updated Curriculum Vitae (CV)\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program\\u003C\\u002Fstrong>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>To apply for the Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Prepare the required documents\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Complete all required personal information accurately.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Input your correct academic details, grades, and NYSC completion status.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Double-check that your phone number and email address are spelled correctly, as these will be used for test invitations.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Upload your CV and certificates in the requested file formats (PDF).\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>Review all entered data for errors.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\u003Cp>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \\u003Ca href=\\\"https:\\u002F\\u002Ftally.so\\u002Fr\\u002FODj2Wa\\\">https:\\u002F\\u002Ftally.so\\u002Fr\\u002FODj2Wa\\u003C\\u002Fa>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\u003Cp>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\",\"2026-06-07 09:54:15\",[270],{\"fileName\":271,\"oldFileName\":271,\"type\":47,\"file\":48,\"url\":272},\"assets\\u002Felearning\\u002Flrm\\u002Fexplore\\u002Fnews\\u002Fardova-plc-graduate-trainee-program-2026-how-to-apply\\u002F6a2531b7104a55.51052352_screenshot 2026-06-07 094545.png\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Flinkskool.com\\u002Fassets\\u002Felearning\\u002Flrm\\u002Fexplore\\u002Fnews\\u002Fardova-plc-graduate-trainee-program-2026-how-to-apply\\u002F6a2531b7104a55.51052352_screenshot%202026-06-07%20094545.png\",{\"total\":14,\"limit\":274,\"currentPage\":275,\"lastPage\":276,\"hasNext\":277,\"hasPrev\":278},25,1,12,true,false]","statusCode":200,"headers":{"content-type":"application/json;charset=utf-8","x-powered-by":"Nuxt"}}